### Audit of order
# @name r36
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ops/order/audit?entityType=Order&entityId={{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### Failed orders
# @name r37
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/failed?size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### Saga of order
# @name r38
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/saga/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### Reconciliation (admin only)
# @name r39
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reconciliation/run
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reconciliation as operator -> 403
# @name r40
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reconciliation/run
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

### Customers (operator)
# @name r41
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers?size=10
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{operatorToken}}

